# Rope Bridge Gorge - the side quest "The Idol's Bridge" played through (plan Relic of the Seventh Tide, side B)
# Two halves at 4 m, the gorge x -6..6; the bridge along z 0 from x -9.2 to 9.2; the porch 20..26 x -3..3 at 4.
island Rope Bridge Gorge
offset 0 0
expect title The Idol's Bridge
walk -24 0 to -12 0 h=4
zone bridge_lip
read Idol warning
walk -12 0 to 0 0 to 10 0 to 14 0 h=4
zone temple_ground
kill Warthog
expect step 3
walk 19 0 to 22 0 h=4
open Idol's offering
expect item TradeToken 6
zone far_porch
expect done
